  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Tunisia in Implementing Pandemic PPR in a One Health Approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support human and animal health sectors under the &quot;one health&quot; approach to fight against epidemics and contribute to the global effort in reducing epidemic and pandemic risks through effective prevention and preparedness. The goal is to bring Tunisia&apos;s national health systems including the animal health sector up to IHR and international standards requirements.</narrative>
  </description>
